      "writtenOn": "2021-06-30T19:51:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If foo is a file, calling stat on foo/bar returns ENOTDIR, not ENOENT:\n```\n$ stat foo; touch foo; stat foo/bar\nstat: cannot statx \u0027foo\u0027: No such file or directory\nstat: cannot statx \u0027foo/bar\u0027: Not a directory\n```\n(I stumbled upon this inadvertently).",
      "parentUuid": "2798a41f_34f98627",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 328,
        "startChar": 30,
        "endLine": 328,
        "endChar": 40
