      "writtenOn": "2021-06-30T20:01:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "fascinating, this seems like something we should log or warn about if it\u0027s not ENOENT -- I assume folks don\u0027t intend to treat a file like a directory and may be surprised that product config isn\u0027t set up as they expect.",
